Description: Minimal REST client and CLI for the TransIP API v6
 Implements only authentication (RSA-signed token request) and generic
 DNS entry management (list/create/delete, any record type TransIP
 supports) - not a full wrapper of TransIP's API.
 .
 Ships the transip-dns command-line tool for ad-hoc DNS management
 (e.g. CAA, DKIM, TXT records), and is used by python3-certbot-dns-transip
 to implement the certbot dns-transip authenticator plugin.
